      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would definitely like this issue looked into as it harms all worlds that try to make a multiplayer experience. Which is almost all worlds!\n\nI'm not sure how much issues exist in VRCs net-code & how much of it is intended server budget saving, but all I can say is it feels more laggy than any game I've played in the last decade by almost a factor of 10. At the point where we are adding V-Bucks its time to be competitive with the rest of the industry surely! Now that we are on a new version of Unity maybe its time for NU24 and 30ms being the standard instead of 300ms",
